Subject: [PATCH 23/25] feat(ui): import errors dismissible toasts collapsing
 duplicates

- Show import failures as popups with a per-toast dismiss button.
- Collapse identical error texts into the newest toast with a repeated-count label.
- Auto-dismiss after 60 seconds and re-arm on a new import batch.
